<title>INDIA: Indian May vehicle production rises.</title>
<headline>Indian May vehicle production rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian production of trucks, cars and two-wheelers rose in May compared to same month in 1996, the Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers (AIAM) said in a monthly statement on Friday.</p>
<p>   PRODUCTION		(number of units)</p>
<p>		   May 97  Apr 97  May 96   Apr-May 97   Apr-May 96</p>
<p>   TRUCKS	23,343  20,157  21,900	43,500	 43,466</p>
<p>   CARS	  37,436  23,157  37,076	60,593	 60,415</p>
<p>   2-WHEELERS 237,246 217,341 233,279     454,587	468,319</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>   SALES		     (number of units)</p>
<p>		   May 97  Apr 97  May 96   Apr-May 97   Apr-May 96</p>
<p>   TRUCKS	19,847  14,245  20,651	34,092	 39,844</p>
<p>   CARS	  36,757  22,093  34,915	58,850	 57,360</p>
<p>   2-WHEELERS 249,549 199,367 236,961     448,916	449,118</p>
<p>-- New Delhi Newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
